   "correctId": "a",
   "explanationHtml": "אם <math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> רגולרית אז גם <math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L^*</annotation></semantics></math> (רגולריות סגורה לכוכבית), ולכן <math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Rank}</annotation></semantics></math> סופי. ההפך נופל על פלינדרומים: הם לא רגולריים (<span class=\"nobr\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Rank}=\\infty</annotation></semantics></math>),</span> אבל כל אות היא פלינדרום ולכן <math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L^*=\\Sigma^*</annotation></semantics></math> ו-<math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Rank}=1</annotation></semantics></math> (בדקנו שכל מילה עד אורך <math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9</annotation></semantics></math> פירוק לפלינדרומים). <span class=\"mwrap\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>L</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Rank}(L^*)</annotation></semantics></math><wbr><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;\\mathrm{Rank}(L)</annotation></semantics></math></span> נופל על <span class=\"nobr\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma^*</annotation></semantics></math>;</span> השוויון נופל על <math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L=\\{a\\}</annotation></semantics></math> (<math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math> מול <span class=\"nobr\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>).</span>",
